-- id: exp6848-v599-method-change-evidence-contract
-  title: V599 method-change and evidence contract
-  track: research
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: codex
-  model: gpt-5.6-sol
-  requires_gpu: false
-  max_turns: 30
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 120
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  milestone: 2026.09.599
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6848_v599_method_change_evidence_contract.json
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    V598 is terminal. The typed fixture producer and the independent capstone disagree about compile
-    parity and readiness. The compatibility task blocked before a live canary. The residual-memory
-    rule was harmful, and the ARC audits lacked effect headroom or first-party tool-gap obligations.
-    This task freezes those results and defines the evidence contract for changed mechanisms.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/research-program.md and {project_root}/_bmad/prd.md, FR11 and FR12
-    - {project_root}/research-references.md, V599 Planner Refresh
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6836_typed_obligation_program_fixture.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6837_three_family_output_free_compatibility.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6842_sealed_memory_pathway_portability_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6843_live_arc_evidence_stratum_freeze.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6844_supervisor_action_outcome_credit_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6845_tool_gap_causal_support_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6847_v598_independent_capstone.json
-    - {project_root}/ops/conductor-log.md and {project_root}/ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    Build an immutable V599 evidence root. Independently recompute the disputed V598 readiness
-    fields, classify terminal and skipped branches, and define frozen-source versus execution-time
-    discovery rules. Verify the V599 reference identifiers. Do not rerun any V598 mechanism and do
-    not invoke an LLM.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require readable terminal V598 artifacts or explicit conductor skip records,
-       stable hashes for immutable inputs, and a clean inventory of missing artifacts. Write
-       complete_blocked_v599_method_change_evidence_contract with gate_check_summary on failure.
-    1. Add REQ-REPORT-6848 and testable scenarios before implementation. Test source drift,
-       producer-auditor disagreement, missing artifact, stale hard-coded path, and terminal null
-       preservation.
-    2. Recompute Exp6836 compile parity and candidate identity counts without importing its reducer.
-       Treat the Exp6847 result as controlling when the two disagree.
-    3. Freeze the Exp6837 resource block, Exp6842 harmful-learning rows, Exp6844 zero-headroom rows,
-       and Exp6845 zero-obligation rows. Do not convert readiness into benefit.
-    4. Define one provenance schema for immutable hashes, dynamic artifact manifests, generator and
-       model identity, process ownership, exact outcome authority, and conductor skips.
-    5. Verify each promoted V599 source against its primary page. Record title, identifier, date,
-       method delta, Carnot hook, and access boundary. Add no new dependency for novelty.
-    6. Write docs/research-notes/v599-method-change-contract.md and the required JSON artifact.
-    7. Run focused tests, ruff, OpenSpec coverage, adversarial verification, artifact convention
-       audit, verdict-row consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.
-    8. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles; preconditions_checked;
-       inference_substrate (deterministic CPU evidence replay); duration_s; source_artifact_hashes;
-       reproducibility_checksum; rows (one source, disputed field, or method decision);
-       producer_auditor_disagreements; terminal_branch_manifest; conductor_skip_manifest;
-       retired_mechanism_manifest; changed_mechanism_manifest; source_access_boundaries;
-       dynamic_evidence_schema; reference_verification_rows; v599_evidence_contract_ready_score
-       (exact field consumed by Exp6849, Exp6850, Exp6853, and Exp6857); gate_check_summary
-       (failed check and observed value for any blocked verdict); verifier_is_oracle (false);
-       verdict_class (positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial);
-       honest_verdict (terminal, row-supported, and prefixed complete_).
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6848_v599_method_change_evidence_contract.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
